The largest signal is a token completing 格, especially a UTF-8 fragment.
Compounds and preceding characters modulate it: prices, cells, and foreign
name endings are weaker than an unqualified 格. Vietnamese cách/giá and
Korean 격 also respond. A following 式 or 子 can retain some activation.
Everything else is zero; this does not model the small background responses.
