    if token == ' Templates' and tail.endswith('choose Tools |'):
        value = 0.76
    if not initial_run and token == '<|im_end|>':
        value = 0.05
    if token == '<tool_call>':
        value = -0.054

    return (doc, position + 1, first, initial_run,
            (tail + token)[-80:]), value

"""Approximate a vocabulary feature for integers, counts and divisibility.

Negative responses mark number/type words, especially qualified integers and
natural numbers. Stronger responses finish 'multiple of', 'divisible by', and
'perfect square'. A short text buffer joins token fragments; TeX integral and
prime commands have positive exceptions, as does chi-square terminology.
